-# Changelog
-
-## [0.4.0] - 2026-04-04
-
-### Added
-- `LicenseManager` — ML-DSA-65 signed license keys (asymmetric PQC, NIST FIPS 204)
-- `npx @taurus-ai/swarm-spawner init` CLI — scaffolds example project
-- Demo GIF in README (recorded with vhs)
